{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/APGIF_1.gif?t=1743548486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atomic Picnic</strong> is a bullet heaven-inspired third-person roguelike shooter! Dive into adrenaline-fueled, high-octane arenas with up to four friends to fight hordes of monsters. Gain experience and upgrade your weapons and skills to create the best build possible to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every Picnic is different, with upgrades that can radically change how you play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/615_0003_PLAY-SOLO-OR-4-PLAYER-CO-OP.png?t=1743548486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/APGIF_2.gif?t=1743548486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start a Picnic solo or with up to three friends in online co-op. Strategize your builds and defeat waves of enemies to level up and take on massive boss battles! But be careful and stick together. Coordination is vital in the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/ATOMIC_STORE_TEXTS_03_airgear.png?t=1743548486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/JUMP_EA.gif?t=1743548486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a Loner, your best friend is your IMPULSE GEAR, a tool you can use to reach heights and distances otherwise impossible. With this tool, you can zip and dash around the map, using the terrain's verticality in your favor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/615_0004_hAME-CHANGING-UPGRADES.png?t=1743548486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/AP_GIF3.gif?t=1743548486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every decision in Atomic Picnic can lead to a radically different build and playstyle. The more upgrades you pick and combine, the stronger you become. Every run is unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/NovAPGif1.gif?t=1743548486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is still being developed, but we want to encourage everyone to participate! We have an active Discord server and would love to hear your feedback and questions!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/NovAPGif2.gif?t=1743548486\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1903560?t=1743548486","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743548486","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/0d2280a6a53036f4cc40499b78250f81b8b0a27e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743548486","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/0d2280a6a53036f4cc40499b78250f81b8b0a27e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743548486","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/EA_Roadmap.png?t=1743548486\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/APGIF_1.gif?t=1743548486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atomic Picnic</strong> is a bullet heaven-inspired third-person roguelike shooter! Dive into adrenaline-fueled, high-octane arenas with up to four friends to fight hordes of monsters. Gain experience and upgrade your weapons and skills to create the best build possible to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every Picnic is different, with upgrades that can radically change how you play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/615_0003_PLAY-SOLO-OR-4-PLAYER-CO-OP.png?t=1743548486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/APGIF_2.gif?t=1743548486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start a Picnic solo or with up to three friends in online co-op. Strategize your builds and defeat waves of enemies to level up and take on massive boss battles! But be careful and stick together. Coordination is vital in the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/ATOMIC_STORE_TEXTS_03_airgear.png?t=1743548486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/JUMP_EA.gif?t=1743548486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a Loner, your best friend is your IMPULSE GEAR, a tool you can use to reach heights and distances otherwise impossible. With this tool, you can zip and dash around the map, using the terrain's verticality in your favor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/615_0004_hAME-CHANGING-UPGRADES.png?t=1743548486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/AP_GIF3.gif?t=1743548486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every decision in Atomic Picnic can lead to a radically different build and playstyle. The more upgrades you pick and combine, the stronger you become. Every run is unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/NovAPGif1.gif?t=1743548486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is still being developed, but we want to encourage everyone to participate! We have an active Discord server and would love to hear your feedback and questions!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/NovAPGif2.gif?t=1743548486\" /></p>","developers":["BitCake Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/93d39d9aecdfbda7ba3b2418dd7b5c6680f2e2c2/header.jpg?t=1743548486","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2022 BitCake Studio. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257108189,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108189/movie480.mp4?t=1740751778","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257108189/movie_max.mp4?t=1740751778"},"name":"1st Major Update Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257108189/5154b92b674c298d414261e5